<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A4.T5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 5</span>: </span><span id="A4.T5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Zingaloom: syntactic analogue of Tinkatongue with no lexical overlap</span></figcaption>
<table id="A4.T5.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
